{"title":"The Indomitable Martial King","synopsis":"Dari studio yang membawakanmu Solo Leveling dan Revenge of the IronBlooded Sword Hound\ndan masih banyak lagi dan Penulis yang Sama yang membawakanm Survival Story of a Sword King in a Fantasy World\nDi sebuah dunia tempat manusia menjual dan membeli spesies dunia lain sebagai budak\nRifenhardt sang Great Mage diperlakukan seperti Demon King karena membantu spesies dari dunia lain\nSebuah party Hero datang untuk mengalahkan Demon King Rifenhardt berhasil melukai para Hero dengan parah tetapi dia menemui ajalnya di tangan MARTIAL KING\nTesslon Time and Space Regression Spell\nNamun dia secara ajaib berhasil merapal spell pilihan terakhir dan mundur ke masa lalu\nTapi Aku menjadi Martial King Tesslon salah satu Hero yang mencoba membunuhku dan yang terkuat di benua ini\nSekarang dimulailah petualangan Rifenhardt sebagai Great Mage sekaligus manusia terkuat secara fisik untuk mengubah dunia","alternative_title":"권왕전생","author":"Redice Studio","artist":"Redice Studio, YANG Kyung-Il","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"5f12efa4-3a83-49a2-98d0-59f89dbe1eff","number":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"53128831-d6c3-46fd-bbd7-782a2deee3a6","number":"143","title":"Chapter 143","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"ea22b031-f26a-4d5d-b037-5c50cba627ae","number":"142","title":"Chapter 142","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"id":"21219ab0-901e-4156-9a89-6998540a1bbf","number":"141","title":"Chapter 141","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"ddda7c43-b341-4ed1-8979-359f6930370b","number":"140","title":"Chapter 140","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"b567e36f-87e9-431e-981c-c4c8b61b8e6f","number":"139","title":"Chapter 139","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"17811dad-067f-438b-948e-1059de73ff13","number":"138","title":"Chapter 138","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"9c7b5d56-a28a-4f62-a6bc-5440a63bd205","number":"137","title":"Chapter 137